# The Dockerfile only ever COPYs `server/` (minus its own node_modules - reinstalled in the
# image) and `build/` (the frontend build output, expected to already exist before `docker
# build` runs - see package.json's build script / CI's build-webapp job). Everything else here
# just bloats the build context sent to the daemon.
**/node_modules
src
app
cypress
public
patches
*.md
.git
.vscode
coverage
lint-report.json
